00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:55.680
October, 1586 - Kyoto - Residence of Chaya Shirōjirō

00:01:55.680 --> 00:02:00.000
Good, good! You have finally arrived at the capital, Lord Ieyasu.

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:06.590
I have been touched by the Chief Advisor's sympathy.

00:02:07.330 --> 00:02:13.100
You even sent me your mother Ōmandokoro.

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:17.700
I had to attend to business of my own and was not able to visit.

00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:20.310
I apologize.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.680
I won't push that issue any further.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:27.980
The important thing is that you are here right now.

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:34.140
I ask you this.

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:38.330
When you are in Osaka Castle, can you please...

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:44.430
...lower your head to me, Hideyoshi.

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:55.640
Listen, Rikyū.

00:02:56.480 --> 00:03:01.170
I do not want you to perform a tea ceremony of transience, no matter how simple it is.

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:06.010
You must welcome our guest properly with the right ceremony.

00:03:12.530 --> 00:03:13.860
As you wish.

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:17.870
For Lord Tokugawa's sake, too.

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:21.530
First Love

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:47.490
Tokugawa Ieyasu shall henceforth be a part of my family!

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:52.130
Protect the eastern provinces properly.

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:53.360
I shall.

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:57.080
As expected, your sake is top class.

00:03:57.760 --> 00:04:00.980
I should have arrived here much sooner.

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:19.480
Our master... for the sake of his people and his vassals,

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:22.940
put up a brilliantly deceptive appearance.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:27.390
Our master is giving us a sign.

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:30.690
He has gotten much stronger.

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:35.830
Now I can be at ease while I'm taking over Kyushu.

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:38.520
We shall proceed on the March of the next year!

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:43.440
Prepare your armies, everyone!

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:51.570
Crap... He's leaving for Kyushu earlier than I thought.

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:57.520
I'll have to lead more than 800 men according to my salary.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:03.120
But due to my Ten Works and the Jurakudai,

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:05.440
I don't have any money left to support my troops.

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:12.430
Master Ueda, is the construction for the mansion going smoothly?

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:17.470
I have invested quite a lot into it. It must be going great, right?

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:23.250
As a warrior, you have to be ready for war at any time.

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:28.960
Hence, I am looking to tone down the mansion.

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:31.670
He's quite smart for someone his age.

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:35.190
You lack the funds for war, Furuori?

00:05:37.610 --> 00:05:42.870
If you are a man of refined tastes, you should have made your move before the Ōtomo clan from the Bungo Province arrived here.

00:05:43.550 --> 00:05:48.530
I am already in charge of protecing Osaka Castle.

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:54.240
You have to somehow make ends meet, even if you have to resort to selling lumber.

00:05:54.960 --> 00:06:00.150
Well, I don't think your mansion can top mine.

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:14.220
Master Hosokawa has a large salary so it will be tough for him to gather all of his troops.

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:18.730
Even so, I do not intend to sacrifice the quality of my mansion.

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:22.180
In that case...

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:27.050
I will have to swallow my pride and ask someone to lend me some money.

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:42.190
How did the tea ceremony held at the main tower go?

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:45.200
Rikyū's tea is superb.

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:47.890
It wasn't drugged, I hope?

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:50.480
My bowel movements have not changed.

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:56.310
But what makes it that delicious?

00:06:58.090 --> 00:07:00.810
I am not a master of tea,

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:02.550
but how do I say this?

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:06.760
I felt like he has never once bragged about his work.

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:10.550
The Chief Advisor is pretty scary,

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:13.870
and I have to make sure not to show any weaknesses in front of him.

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:16.240
But...

00:07:17.590 --> 00:07:20.010
Rikyū is even scarier.

00:07:20.970 --> 00:07:26.090
I do not think there is anyone in the world who can maintain their guard after drinking that tea.

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:53.550
Who is that?

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:58.900
The Chief Advisor's concubine, Lady Chacha.

00:07:59.550 --> 00:08:03.650
She's Oichi's daughter and Lord Nobunaga's niece.

00:08:05.590 --> 00:08:06.780
This is dangerous.

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:12.930
This castle is full of people easily swayed from the right path.

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:23.580
I have been waiting for you.

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:25.730
Aren't you Lord Furuta?

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:30.330
Let me guide you to the west wing.

00:08:31.640 --> 00:08:36.040
I've been using the tea spoon you gave me.

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:38.860
I need to thank you.

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:41.890
If that's the case...

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:45.440
our food supplies are quite depleted...

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:53.550
Do you understand now!?

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:01.420
I wouldn't have to beat you like this if you did understand!

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:01.990
Yes.

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:03.890
Kita no Mandokoro!

00:09:05.070 --> 00:09:06.830
Lord Tokugawa is here!

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:14.500
Seems like I came at a bad time.

00:09:16.050 --> 00:09:19.210
I'm sorry for showing you something so unsightly.

00:09:19.690 --> 00:09:21.000
What is going on here?

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:22.850
I can't believe this! 

00:09:24.480 --> 00:09:28.390
This girl was fooling around while the Chief Advisor was away on business!

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:32.320
What if the enemy attacked then!?

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:37.530
Entire castles have gone down in flames due to a single woman's carelessness!

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:39.800
She's right.

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:43.890
Let me hold her.

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:48.200
Your child likes to cry a lot.

00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:56.320
If you roll around your child like this,

00:09:56.440 --> 00:09:58.230
he'll grow up nice and strong.

00:10:02.970 --> 00:10:05.780
Maybe you have heard the same thing from your mother, Lord Tokugawa?

00:10:07.010 --> 00:10:13.880
When I was little, I was separated temporarily from my mother.

00:10:17.870 --> 00:10:19.530
Let us go.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:30.810
Lord Tokugawa?

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:34.510
Now you're all smiles!

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:46.000
Grow up quickly!

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:13.110
Did you fall in love with Lady One?

00:11:16.180 --> 00:11:18.340
She is quite amazing.

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:21.650
I am jealous of the Chief Advisor.

00:11:22.310 --> 00:11:26.660
No need to hold back your words here. We are by ourselves.

00:11:27.590 --> 00:11:31.920
If you ever need to meet Lady One,

00:11:32.260 --> 00:11:36.790
I can help you out with that, secretly.

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:45.780
You said a few days ago that you wanted to thank me.

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:48.770
Well then.

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:57.870
I want to discuss some monetary matters with you before we depart for Kyushu.

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:05.410
February, 1587 - Suruga Province, Sunpu Castle

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:22.910
My vassals, my people, I'm sorry.

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:27.890
I secretly spent your hard-earned money.

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:32.590
I am still immature.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:39.040
 "Love Kita" = Love for Kita no Mandokoro = Chief Advisor's Wife

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:46.920
February, 1587 - Nagato Province, Akamagaseki

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:12.560
What should we do, Lord Furuta?

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:16.740
We still lack 50 men.

00:13:18.600 --> 00:13:20.670
We may have started marching late,

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:24.330
but we will have to go through an inspection before we reach Kyushu.

00:13:25.010 --> 00:13:27.190
Lord Ishida is doing the inspections.

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:30.500
No chance of fooling him, eh?

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:35.920
If only Lord Tokugawa's gold can reach us sooner...

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:41.030
Who are they?

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:46.250
Shogun Ashikaga Yoshiaki's men.

00:13:47.100 --> 00:13:49.860
I heard their army is a mish-mash, too.

00:13:51.650 --> 00:13:54.330
He is still the Shogun, even if in name only.

00:13:56.410 --> 00:13:59.270
I don't think he'll be punished for not having enough men.

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:01.970
Lord Furuta!?

00:14:04.090 --> 00:14:04.820
Everyone!

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:07.140
Listen to me!

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:12.270
All of you have families, too.

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:14.980
What heavy responsibilities you bear.

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:22.650
If you join forces with me, I will give you more rice than Lord Yoshiaki!

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:29.280
All you'll be doing is switching flags.

00:14:41.300 --> 00:14:43.610
850 men, confirmed!

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:46.570
What is with that flag?

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:48.050
Excuse me.

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:52.450
I don't think you can appreciate the simplicity of such handwriting.

00:14:56.340 --> 00:14:57.930
You may pass.

00:15:00.690 --> 00:15:04.040
Thank you so much, Shogun.

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:07.910
I'll be going first.

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:22.880
As you can see, three forces dominate Kyushu.

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:27.270
Bungo's Ōtomo Sōrin.

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:30.540
Chikuzen's Akizuki Tanezane.

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:33.760
And Satsuma's Shimazu Yoshihisa.

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:39.050
Ōtomo has sided with Toyotomi already.

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:42.740
Akizuki and Shimazu are still resisting.

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:47.560
We shall split our 25,000 men into two parties.

00:15:47.650 --> 00:15:52.310
We go after both of them at once to control all of Kyushu!

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:54.310
Hidenaga.

00:15:55.230 --> 00:16:01.040
Take 15,000 men, meet up with Ōtomo and attack Satsuma.

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:01.880
Yes, milord!

00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:12.530
The main force will attack Akizuki.

00:16:12.590 --> 00:16:13.370
But...

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:38.200
The Triumvirate...

00:16:38.910 --> 00:16:44.600
Tokugawa gifted us the Hatsuhana and Ōtomo gifted us the Nitta.

00:16:45.570 --> 00:16:50.980
We still lack the last one.

00:16:53.050 --> 00:17:00.060
Akizuki has the Narashiba that he took from the rich merchant from Hakata, Shimai Soushitsu.

00:17:01.530 --> 00:17:04.860
I shall rescue the Narashiba from Akizuki.

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:13.050
By completing the Triumvirate, I fulfill Lord Nobunaga's will.

00:17:17.600 --> 00:17:22.330
Make sure not to use fire when assaulting Akizuki's castle.

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:26.490
Rescuing the Narashiba is of utmost priority.

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:29.270
Hidekatsu! Hideyasu!

00:17:29.390 --> 00:17:29.960
Here!

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:36.050
As my adopted sons, you two shall lead my forces. Do your very best.

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:44.680
When we depart for Kyushu,

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:51.540
please let my son Hideyasu who was taken in by the Chief Advisor lead the fight.

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:55.280
What a difficult situation.

00:17:57.030 --> 00:18:01.880
If I don't help out Lord Hideyasu and prove my worth in battle...

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:05.130
I will not get any rewards from the Chief Advisor.

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:07.660
I will not be able to return Lord Ieyasu's favor.

00:18:08.140 --> 00:18:11.660
Forget about relaxing in my mansion at Jurakudai.

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:15.760
And we cannot use fire.

00:18:16.140 --> 00:18:18.650
It will be hard for my tiny army to do anything!

00:18:20.520 --> 00:18:21.450
What should I do?

00:18:28.890 --> 00:18:32.210
Akizuki's castle is on a steep mountain.

00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:35.330
How should we attack?

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:43.010
This is the first time I've heard you talk like a warrior.

00:18:45.340 --> 00:18:50.290
Speaking of castles on mountains, my ancestors came from Shinshu Ueda, a mountainous region.

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:53.720
I may not have grown up in the mountains,

00:18:54.130 --> 00:18:58.850
but you should know Sanada, the leader of the Ueda clan.

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:02.340
Sanada? The one who came with us to attack Kyushu?

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:05.230
Sanada Nobushige?

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:11.580
Master Nobushige has been called a mountain god since he was little.

00:19:12.030 --> 00:19:16.540
He has spies all over the place and can break through the enemy defenses in an instant.

00:19:20.350 --> 00:19:23.280
But I don't need any spies.

00:19:23.360 --> 00:19:26.540
My single spear will defeat all of them.

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:34.690
Can I meet this mountain god?

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:38.400
April 1st - Kyushu - Buzen Province, Ganjaku Castle

00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:46.600
Ganjaku Castle has fallen. We have also razed Masutomi Castle.

00:19:47.190 --> 00:19:50.740
April 2nd - Chikuzen Province, Koshosan Castle

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:54.880
This is Koshosan Castle, the stronghold of Kyushu.

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:57.760
We can see every of our enemy's movements.

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:04.590
Even if this castle falls...

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:09.500
This Narashiba, worth more than all of Kyushu...

00:20:10.010 --> 00:20:11.880
I shall never relinquish it!

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:18.650
Lord Akizuki! Lord Akizuki!

00:20:20.340 --> 00:20:24.490
Masutomi Castle should have been razed yesterday!

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:28.240
What!? In only one day!?

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:31.440
The monkey rebuilt it!?

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:40.600
Akizuki, you fool.

00:20:40.950 --> 00:20:45.050
You must be scared to your bones right now at what you are seeing.

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:49.630
An army that can rebuild a castle in a single day is coming for you!

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:54.590
But Akizuki has refused all of our attempts at negotiation.

00:20:55.130 --> 00:20:58.730
That's fine. Send another messenger out again tomorrow.

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:00.950
He'll give up soon enough.

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:04.010
Let the soldiers rest tonight.

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:09.190
Tonight's my final chance at glory.

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:24.930
No matter how much you plead, I will not lend you a spy.

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:32.500
I, Sanada Nobushige, am planning on having my spies ambush Koshosan Castle tonight.

00:21:33.070 --> 00:21:35.420
I will have Akizuki's head.

00:21:36.150 --> 00:21:38.520
That will be very difficult.

00:21:39.120 --> 00:21:45.950
But it will be easy for you to infiltrate the treasure room and rescue the Narashiba.

00:21:46.720 --> 00:21:49.810
That will be your greatest accomplishment.

00:21:51.320 --> 00:21:52.430
But!

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:58.340
Without the proper eyes, you can't complete this task. Right?

00:22:06.170 --> 00:22:09.760
Are you planning on taking all the glory yourself?

00:22:10.390 --> 00:22:15.650
It must have been tough, coming all the way from Shinshu.

00:22:16.680 --> 00:22:20.410
I do feel your hardship.

00:22:24.500 --> 00:22:26.990
Half the glory will be yours.

00:22:27.940 --> 00:22:29.720
Just in case,

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:36.220
I shall leave the rope that ties my scabbard to my waist here as collateral.

00:22:40.030 --> 00:22:43.660
Two white stripes align the green cotton weave.

00:22:45.370 --> 00:22:47.750
This is some good stuff, Lord Sanada.

00:23:03.470 --> 00:23:06.200
Everytime I　

00:23:03.470 --> 00:23:06.200
Anata no mune

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:08.590
feel your heart

00:23:06.360 --> 00:23:08.590
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:14.680
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:14.680
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.600 --> 00:23:20.860
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.600 --> 00:23:20.860
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:27.020
Oppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:27.020
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:27.860 --> 00:23:33.110
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:27.860 --> 00:23:33.110
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.110 --> 00:23:36.990
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.110 --> 00:23:36.990
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.220 --> 00:23:40.570
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.220 --> 00:23:40.570
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:40.770 --> 00:23:46.440
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:40.770 --> 00:23:46.440
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.540 --> 00:23:49.440
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.540 --> 00:23:49.440
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.520 --> 00:23:52.050
Without each other.

00:23:49.520 --> 00:23:52.050
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.140 --> 00:23:53.010
You should

00:23:52.140 --> 00:23:53.010
Soshite

00:23:53.100 --> 00:23:58.510
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.100 --> 00:23:58.510
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.620 --> 00:24:02.300
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.620 --> 00:24:02.300
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.360 --> 00:24:08.010
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.360 --> 00:24:08.010
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.090 --> 00:24:14.500
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.090 --> 00:24:14.500
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.560 --> 00:24:20.300
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.560 --> 00:24:20.300
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:21.780 --> 00:24:26.280
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:21.780 --> 00:24:26.280
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:34.460 --> 00:24:36.160
Hell's watchdog!

00:24:39.170 --> 00:24:40.840
Bling!

00:24:45.200 --> 00:24:46.940
Wear this.

00:24:50.090 --> 00:24:52.010
The Devil's Whisper.

00:24:52.920 --> 00:24:58.060
To be a warrior or an aestete? That is the question.

00:24:56.450 --> 00:24:59.540
The Devil's Whisper
